The source-package builder excludes installed dependencies and generated
dependency bundles. `package.json` and `pnpm-lock.yaml` identify dependencies
and resolved versions, but the lockfile does not contain their license texts.
Each upstream package's declared license and notice remains applicable. Any
distribution that includes third-party dependency code or assets must carry
the notices required for the exact components shipped.
